<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#fire-arrow">Glossary</a> · Term · weapon</p><h1 class="enc-title">Fire arrow</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as fire arrows</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">A fire arrow was an arrow carrying an incendiary or <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gunpowder">gunpowder</a> charge. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/song-dynasty">Song Dynasty</a> developed and used gunpowder weapons, including fire arrows, bombs and early firearms, well before they appeared elsewhere, partly to compensate for its weakness against mounted nomadic armies.</p></div>
